        historical_note: "A double-barrel 10-gauge shotgun with short barrels, designed for use by stagecoach guards and lawmen. The double barrels allowed two quick shots, and the wide spread of buckshot meant devastating effect at close range. Both barrels could be fired simultaneously for a single massive volley.",
