        historical_note: "The iconic American fighting knife, popularized by James Bowie at the Sandbar Fight of 1827. Characterized by a large clip-point blade with a sharpened false edge. A versatile tool and weapon carried throughout the frontier, it was as essential to a frontiersman as a firearm.",
